#. 僕の発言とその証拠…
#. 何か矛盾している点でもあるのだろうか？
msgctxt "0001 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You think you have some proof that contradicts what I\n"
"said...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 僕の発言とその証拠…
#. 何か矛盾している点でもあるのだろうか？
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You think you have some proof that contradicts what I\n"
"said...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ああ？　それが犯人がナイフで刺した事と
#. どう関係するってんだ？
msgctxt "0005 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Huh? So the killer used their pocketknife or whatever.\n"
"So what?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>待てよ…今のあの人の発言って…
#. ボクの知っている情報と違う気がするけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hold on... I feel like what I just heard is different\n"
"from what I already know.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの腹部に刺さってた刃物…
#. あれは、おそらく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because the object that was thrust into Sayaka's\n"
"stomach...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの場所からなくなっていた刃物だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was almost certainly the knife that disappeared\n"
"from a certain location...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
